<li>Tested in the following Browsers:
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Firefox Nightly 141 - not working</li>
<li>Firefox Beta 140 - not working</li>
<li>Chrome 136 - works as expected</li>
<li>Safari 18.5 - works as expected<br>
Tested with the following codepens:</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="https://codepen.io/CodeRedDigital/pen/LEVNgqL?editors=1111" rel="nofollow">CSS Highlight .add()</a></li>
<li><a href="https://codepen.io/CodeRedDigital/pen/LEVNBOm?editors=1111" rel="nofollow">HighlightRegistry.set()</a></li>
</ul>
